    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Award-winning commercial director/editor and photographer, based between London and LA, Arts Institute at Bournemouth grad. Senior level, roughly 10+ years: career through Great Guns, CAMALEON Contenidos, Armoury and Hobnob before current repping deal at Madrefoca; site lists simultaneous territory reps (Armoury UK, Madre US, Madrefoca Mexico, Lovestone Germany), which is the standard freelance-director model, so Work Status set Freelance despite LinkedIn reading Film Director at Madrefoca (treated as the rep relationship, not employment). Clients include BMW, Hyundai, Cisco, Bose, SK-II, Cornerstone; D&AD Next Director nomination (Chevrolet) and Cannes Lions shortlist (Keeper's Heart Whisky). Photo side has its own UK rep (AMP Agency) and an honourable mention (International Photography Awards, Precious series). Autonomy estimated 4: runs full productions and sets his own creative vision, no first-hand evidence of him personally, hedged from career trajectory and awards record.",
